Milestone 20 — Customer Cases / Support Management V1

Goal: add a generic support Case module for customer issues/requests, deeply integrated with existing CRM records and Shared Inbox.

Do NOT implement ecommerce-specific returns/refunds, knowledge base, live chat, AI support, telephony, advanced SLA rules, or customer portal.

